sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: FootyLevels reconstruction and private playback
    accDescr: A bounded request creates an idempotent durable job. A credential-free adapter invokes the existing serial GPU model and cloud-aware parent workers verify and publish private assets for validated RealityKit playback.
    autonumber
    participant App as iOS app
    participant API as Authenticated API
    participant DB as Firestore jobs and results
    participant Worker as Reconstruction worker
    participant Model as Private model via Unix IPC
    participant Store as Supabase private files
    App->>API: Submit keyframes or motion segment with inputRevision
    API->>DB: Transactional owner, prepared source, bounds and semantic job identity
    DB-->>API: Existing identical job or new queued job
    API-->>App: 202 and durable job ID
    Worker->>DB: Claim one eligible job with lease and attempt
    Worker->>Store: Download and verify pinned prepared video
    Worker->>Worker: Start credential-free adapter in bounded private workspace
    alt Selected keyframes
        Worker->>Model: Private IPC: exact JPEG frames, boxes and provenance
        Model->>Model: Reuse warm body estimator in serial executor
        Model-->>Worker: keyframes.json and successful GLBs
    else Bounded motion segment
        Worker->>Model: Private IPC: verified trimmed segment and provenance
        Model->>Model: Release warm estimator and tracking and body stages execute serially
        Model-->>Worker: sequence.json, faces.bin, gzip chunks, video and previews
        Model->>Model: Rewarm body estimator
    end
    Worker->>DB: Heartbeat and check current lease, revision and cancellation
    Worker->>Worker: Validate files, timestamps, topology, hashes and missing-frame accounting
    Worker->>DB: Reserve immutable attempt outputs within free-plan quotas
    Worker->>Store: Upload and independently verify artifacts
    Worker->>DB: Fenced transaction: immutable result, job succeeded or partial, project pointer
    Worker->>Worker: Remove private staging
    App->>API: Poll owned job, then GET reconstruction metadata
    App->>API: POST reconstruction assets
    API-->>App: Five-minute allowlisted asset map
    App->>Store: Read manifest and referenced files
    App->>App: Verify bytes, hashes, topology and timestamps and render with RealityKit
